sglang.bodyExcerpt:
Motivation
Follow-up to #37480 (FastH3 with the VSA-H3 backend). This PR:

moves native FastH3 support to the current checkpoint, FastVideo/FastVideo-FastH3-8-Step-V2, which replaces the 4-step preview;
adds FastVideo's native Blackwell VSA kernel;
speeds up the rest of the request path: denoise, VA

vllm.bodyExcerpt:
Summary
Fix the frontend ZMQ port TOCTOU by keeping the kernel listener bound continuously from port allocation through frontend startup.
The supervisor now:

binds each TCP or IPC listener before engine or frontend launch;
records the resolved endpoint;
passes the listener to the Python child or Ru
